What's new in this Version:

* Set PA_STATUS to have install, update, remove, and get print machine readable phase lines and a download progress bar, used by the Selkies application interface to show progress and stages
* New list command prints installed apps by the name the other commands take, skipping unfinished downloads, and is included in bash completion
* An interrupted download no longer leaves a partial app root behind, and install or get discard any leftover unfinished download and start over
* The system socket is created with owner only permissions from the start instead of being restricted after creation
